00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.609
Now, what is hypoglycemia?

00:00:05.609 --> 00:00:09.599
Hypoglycemia is a situation where the blood
sugars go too low.

00:00:09.599 --> 00:00:13.290
Normally in the body you should have blood
sugars of 100.

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:14.759
What does that mean?

00:00:14.759 --> 00:00:16.350
I'll give you a little comparison.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:22.240
If you were to weigh let's say 180 pounds,
you'd have about a gallon and a half of blood

00:00:22.240 --> 00:00:23.590
in your entire body.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:29.650
The amount of sugar that would be diluted
in there to equal 100 would be about one teaspoon,

00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:31.800
so it's really very small amounts of sugar.

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:37.110
And it doesn't mean you have to eat sugar,
your body can make sugar from other types

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:39.150
of things, like protein, even fat.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:42.400
So it's not that you even have to eat any
sugar at all.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.380
But the point is that we need this normal
blood sugar to maintain fuel in the body.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:48.580
Okay, it should be 100.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:53.990
When it drops down below 70 that's when you
start getting the symptoms of hypoglycemia.

00:00:53.990 --> 00:01:00.790
Brain fog, cravings for sweets, anxiety, fatigue,
shakiness, weakness.

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:05.430
It's kind of like if you have kids, you know,
and let's say you're bringing them grocery

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:07.649
shopping with you when they're hungry and
tired.

00:01:07.649 --> 00:01:11.850
They're going to experience all these, specifically
irritability, right?

00:01:11.850 --> 00:01:16.509
And that's how low blood sugar ... And they're
just going the go a little crazy on you.

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:20.421
The point is that when those blood sugars
crash it pushes you out of the present and

00:01:20.421 --> 00:01:25.380
you don't think rationally, and you'll eat
things that you end up regretting.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:31.840
Here's what happens, and this is the problem,
is that the doctors, the medical profession

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:37.529
is telling people to keep some candy in their
pocket, or glucose tablets.

00:01:37.529 --> 00:01:42.450
In case your blood sugars run low, go ahead
