00:02:42.819 --> 00:02:48.489
It has to do with the opposing hormone to
insulin.

00:02:48.489 --> 00:02:55.890
Insulin reacts to glucose, and what it does
is it lowers blood sugar.

00:02:55.890 --> 00:03:01.770
So there's a hormone that does the opposite,
and it's made by the pancreas.

00:03:01.770 --> 00:03:06.300
Insulin is made by the pancreas, but this
